values ('c9d0e1f2-3a4b-4c76-9d56-6f7a8b9c0d66', 'diversity-equity-and-multicultural-education', 'Diversity, Equity, and Multicultural Education', 'This course prepares future educators to build culturally sustaining, inclusive, and equity-centered classrooms. Students examine identity, culture, race, language, gender, sexuality, religion, disability, socioeconomic inequality, anti-bias education, family and community partnership, curriculum representation, classroom climate, civil-rights obligations, and systems-level equity data. The course emphasizes rigorous instruction, belonging, critical reflection, professional responsibility, and practical strategies for teaching across diverse cultural contexts.');

